141;1;%4Device %1 : Actual filling level %2 is not plausible, please start referencing the device;1. By component replacement or installation work, the level detection has been affected%CrLf%2. Defective measuring device of level detection system;Eliminar erro e inicializar referenciamento.
141;2;%4Device %1 : Level measurement system is not referenced, please start referencing the device;1. Retain data has been deleted%CrLf%2. Error while reading retain data during startup of robot control;Eliminar erro e inicializar referenciamento.
