141;6;%4 Device %1 : Error during referencing of level control system. Increment value for Min. = %2 out of specification %3;- Painting canister is not in requested limit position for referencing%CrLf%- Measurement system is faulty%CrLf%- Required valves do not open;- Check requested limit position of paint can (visually)%CrLf%- Check measuring system%CrLf%- Check required valve functions (Time program: Referenz Can)
