594;6;%4Disparador para ponto %1 até quando o último sinal estiver colocado;Reaching a measuring point is signaled to the Zeiss sensor by setting a bit on the interface. While this bit is still set, the next measuring point should already be signaled.;Increase the spatial and/or temporal distance between the measuring points (Z_TRIGGER or Z_TRIGGER_DIRECT) and restart the program.
594;7;%4The interface to the Zeiss sensor has been configured, but without activating the extended interface;O parâmetro a seguir tem que ser ativado na configuração.%CrLf%[RC.KINEMATIC:0.Vision]%CrLf%UseExtendedPLCinterface   = 1;Verificar a configuração e reinicializar controlador.
594;8;%4Can not create directory %1 for logging the measurement and correction values.;Tentativa de criar diretório indicado. Isto, porém, não foi possível.%CrLf%* Caminho objeto está reservado%CrLf%* Recusado acesso ao disco rígido por razões de sistema%CrLf%* problema interno controlador;Verificar o caminho indicado através do Explorer.
594;9;%4Erro ao escrever arquivo %1.;Tentativa de cirar arquivo indicado. Isto, porém, não foi possível.%CrLf%* consta arquivo, porém este é só de leitura%CrLf%* recusado acesso ao disco rígido por razões do sistema.;Verificar o caminho indicado através do Explorer.
594;10;%4Valores de correção fora da margem de tolerância ;The correction values from the Zeiss measuring computer are absolutely greater than the permissible parameterized limit values.;A carroceria não deve ser pintada.
594;11;%4Correction values for measuring point %1 outside the tolerance range.;The correction values from the Zeiss measuring computer are absolutely greater than the permissible parameterized limit values.;A carroceria não deve ser pintada.
594;12;%4Too many measurement points in the program.. Actual = %1, allowed = %2;The allowed number of measuring points has been exceeded;Reduce the number of measuring points or let the control manufacturer increase the permitted number.
594;13;%4The trigger signal for the Zeiss sensor (%1) could not be assigned;Não foi possível mapear os pontos finais citados do hardware do satélite do barramento de campo.%CrLf%Denominações diferentes dos pontos finais do hardware no gestor Kemro e RCU.%CrLf%Não foi criada entrada no gestor Kemro.;Examinar configuração no gestor Kemro e conferir com manual do interface,%CrLf%em seguida reinicializar controlador.
594;14;%4Invalid measurement point type at point number %1;An incorrect measuring point was used in the teach program.;Controlar e adaptar programa de ensino.
594;15;%4Too few measurement points to calculate corrections for the area %1;There are not enough measurement points to calculate corrections. For each of the 4 edges of the surface there must be at least 2 measuring points.;Set up additional measuring points with the Z_TRIGGER or Z_TRIGGER_DIRECT macros.
594;16;%4The specified area % 1 is not valid.;No measurement has been made for this area or an incorrect number has been used.;Check surface number and/or perform measurement.
594;17;%4The minimum distance in %1 direction was undercut. Value = % 2. Minimum = % 3;2 measuring points are too close to each other. For the calculation of the corrections on the surface, a minimum distance between two neighboring measuring points for one edge is necessary.;Increase the distance between the measuring points (Z_TRIGGER or Z_TRIGGER_DIRECT) and restart the program.
594;18;%4Correction values for the point %1 can not be calculated.;Arrangement of the measuring points and the boundaries of the surface are geometrically faulty.;Check measurement program and parameterization of the measuring points.
